[3] <a href="https://arxiv.org/abs/1609.04309">Efficient softmax approximation for GPUs</a><br>
[4] <a href="https://github.com/QwenLM/Qwen/issues/419">qwen 词表大小的一些疑问</a><br>
[5] <a href="https://arxiv.org/pdf/2309.10305">Baichuan 2: Open Large-scale Language Models<br>
